        "raw": "Greetings All!\n\nWas playing against Citizen Dawn earlier today, and \"Channel the Eclipse\" was played:\n\n\"At the end of the Villain Turn, Citizen Dawn deals herself 2 cold damage; play the top card of the villain deck.\"\n\nAnd she put into play Citizen Summer:\n\"At the end of the Villain turn, this card deals the two heroes with the most cards in play 3 fire damage.\"\n\nDoes Citizen Summer's ability take effect if she comes in at the end of the turn, from an ability that took place at the end of the turn?",
